      "statement": "chatPipeline.runChatPipeline is the single orchestrator shared by POST /api/v1/chat (JSON, emit=null) and POST /api/v1/chat/stream (SSE); it races executePipeline against a 15 s pipeline timeout and an optional AbortSignal, and on timeout/abort/error returns a degraded language-aware fallback reply while best-effort persisting only the user message.",
