      "statement": "Groq calls go through callGroqWithRetry (3 attempts max, 500/1500 ms backoff, HTTP 429 and queue-fallback abort retries immediately; model llama-3.3-70b-versatile, temperature 0.7, max_tokens 400) and groqQueue.callGroq, which caps Groq at 27 calls per calendar minute via a Redis counter chat:groq:rpm:<YYYYMMDDHHmm> (TTL 90 s), enqueues overflow into a Redis FIFO capped at 100 with a 10 s deadline resolving { fallback: true, reason: 'deadline_exceeded' }, and falls back to an in-memory counter/queue when Redis is unavailable.",
